      "widgets_values": [
        "Full-Width Interaction Module :: [Position 3: Human Interaction] + [Front View Perspective] + [Visual Description: An anime-style female model in a pink blazer cozying up and hugging the plush doll close to her chest. The doll is facing forward, showing its expressive eyes and golden jewelry accents. The composition uses a medium shot to emphasize the scale and soft-touch premium fabric of the doll against the model's outfit.] :: [Style: Vibrant character illustration, clean cel-shading, Image 2 inspired palette] :: Text \"SOFT PREMIUM FABRIC FOR ULTIMATE COMFORT\", 【核心生成规则】\n1. **拒绝“纯摄影”**：\n   - 严禁生成“一张照片上飘着几个字”的简单图片。\n   - 必须生成**“平面设计稿”**（Graphic Design）。\n   - 画面中必须包含：**色块容器（Text Box）、装饰线条、排版栅格、或矢量图标**。\n2. **结构复刻**：\n   - 仔细观察图2的排版结构。如果图2用了“圆角卡片”，请在画面中绘制圆角卡片来承载文字。\n   - 如果图2用了“图标阵列”，请在画面中绘制类似的图标阵列。\n   - 让画面看起来像经过专业排版的亚马逊 A+ 页面，而不是一张手机随拍。\n3. **图像分工**：\n   - 图1 = 产品主体。\n   - 图2 = **排版结构与配色参考库**。\n4. **文字规则**：\n   - 仅学习图2的字体风格。绝对禁止抄写图2的内容。\n   - 文案完全替换为提示词中的内容。",
        "",
        "gemini-3-pro-image-preview-vip",
        1,
        "Auto",
        9627,
        "randomize",
        0.95,
        "2K",
        "心宝❤新渠道",
